# =====================================================================
# Cloudflare Pages — response headers
#
# Read by Cloudflare Pages at deploy time. Has no effect when opening
# the files locally over file:// — that is expected.
# =====================================================================

/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Referrer-Policy: no-referrer
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(), microphone=(), camera=(), interest-cohort=()
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; img-src 'self' data:; style-src 'self'; font-src 'self'; script-src 'self'; connect-src 'self' https://api.phantaslate.com; frame-ancestors 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'none'

# Notes on the policy above:
#
#   Everything is 'self'. The site makes no third-party request of any
#   kind — no font CDN, no analytics, no embedded media. If a future
#   change needs an external origin, that is worth a deliberate decision
#   rather than a quiet widening of this line.
#
#   'unsafe-inline' is absent from BOTH script-src and style-src. Keep
#   all JavaScript in assets/js/ and all styling in assets/css/. An
#   inline <script> or a style="" attribute will work perfectly on your
#   machine and be blocked in production — an easy way to ship something
#   silently broken.
#
#   connect-src already permits api.phantaslate.com, so the try-it panel
#   will work the moment DEMO_MODE is switched off in assets/js/demo.js.

/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/*.html
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate
